# What the Vercel deploy is allowed to upload: ONLY the website (docs), the small server functions (api) and vercel.json.
# Everything else in this folder (the app's source code, .env and other secrets, planning documents, PDFs, scripts) stays on
# this computer. Rewritten 2026-11-16: the old file excluded by FILE TYPE (*.json, *.js, *.ts ...), which also swallowed
# docs/app-version.json and api/sponsors.js, and it did not exclude .env or the planning folder at all.
/*
!/docs
!/api
!/vercel.json
